# NovaSpend bottom sheets

**Canonical reference:** `NovaSpend/lib/features/search/presentation/widgets/date_range_sheet.dart` (+ `date_range_calendar.dart` for inline pickers). Match this chrome and interaction model when building new sheets.

## Shell

```dart
showModalBottomSheet<T>(
  context: context,
  isScrollControlled: true,
  useSafeArea: true,
  backgroundColor: Colors.transparent,
  builder: (_) => MySheet(...),
);
```

- Sheet body: `AppColors.surface(brightness)`, top radius **28**, `clipBehavior: Clip.antiAlias`.
- Drag handle: 40×4, `AppColors.border` @ ~55% opacity, pill radius.
- Cap height (~90% screen) with `Flexible` + `SingleChildScrollView` for long content; keep primary actions **outside** the scroll (pinned footer).
- Padding: `AppSpacing.md` sides/bottom, `AppSpacing.sm` top.

## Header

- Title left (`titleLarge` ~18–20 / w700) + **circular close** top-right.
- Close: `AppColors.neutralFill` circle, `Icons.close_rounded`, `Navigator.pop()` with no result (dismiss ≠ apply/clear).

## Option rows (selectable lists)

- Selected fill: `AppColors.navActiveFill(brightness)`; label/icon: `AppColors.primaryStrong`.
- Leading icon in a **40px circle**: selected → same fill as row + **solid accent border**; unselected → soft `neutralFill` + `border`.
- Trailing selected mark: **filled accent circle** with white `Icons.check_rounded` (not a bare check glyph).
- Subtitles for context (dates, hints); single-day ranges use one date, not `A – A`.
- Allow **tap-selected-again to deselect** when the filter is optional.

## Footer actions

- Primary: `FilledButton`, `AppColors.primaryStrong`, height **52**, `AppRadius.md`.
- Override theme padding — use **horizontal-only** padding + `minimumSize`/`maximumSize` height 52 + `height: 1.2` on label so text is not clipped.
- Secondary **Clear** (`TextButton`) only when a filter is already applied; return a distinct cleared result (not the same as dismiss).
- Prefer a small result type: applied / cleared / `null` dismissed.

## Motion & expand-in-place

- Tokens: `AppMotion.fast/normal/slow` + `AppMotion.standard`.
- Expanding sections (e.g. custom picker): soft **fade + slide-up + slight scale**; one **single** `animateTo(maxScrollExtent)` after layout — do **not** multi-jump scroll during size animation (causes flicker).
- Inline pickers beat stacked platform `showDatePicker` dialogs when choosing ranges.

## Tokens & copy

- Colors/spacing/radius from `AppColors` / `AppSpacing` / `AppRadius` only — no feature-local palettes.
- All strings via `context.l10n` / ARB keys.
